  "title": "The Unmasked Podcast",
  "subtitle": "",
  "description": "Voted Best Black Fiction Podcast, Unmasked follows the healing journey of a high-achieving female executive, after she’s found herself in a series of toxic relationships. When she’s forced to confront old wounds that she’s been avoiding for far too long, she turns to therapy. Echoing relatable and empowering narratives of TV shows like \"Being Mary Jane\" and HBO’s \"Insecure,\" Unmasked invites listeners into Kenya's world as she navigates love, her career and her failures, through the lens of her therapist.",
